# Files that live in the repo but are not part of the website. Vercel serves
# every file it deploys, so anything left in would be publicly fetchable at
# /docs/..., /scripts/..., and so on.
#
# Safe to leave out: nothing here is read at runtime. data/ and lib/ are NOT
# listed on purpose -- the serverless functions import lib/ and read data/.
docs
scripts
.claude
.github
README.md
